<div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
      		
	<p n="1-4">
		<supplied reason="subaudible">This is the</supplied> stone <supplied reason="subaudible">erected when</supplied> Kākka Nīlaṉ,
		the servant of Perumpāṇaraicaru<note>That is, Perumpāṇaraiyar.</note> Mēkkaṭaliṟaiyaru,
		went <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>ceṉṟu</foreign><note>Literally: having gone.</note></supplied> in a fight <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>pūcal</foreign></supplied> and died.		
	</p>
	
</div>
      	
